CHAPTER.VERS:
And immediately Jesus, perceiving in his spirit that they so reasoned to themselves, says to them, Why do you

          {+}
         reason these things in your

          {+}
         hearts?

But that you

          {+}
         may know that the Son of Man has authority on earth to forgive sins--he says to the sick of the palsy:

And he says to them, Did you

          {+}
         never read what David did, when he had need, and was hungry, he, and those who were with him?
